WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:13.896
If a wedding parent with a short neck wears a low bun set below the nape, the bun covers the hanbok collar, making the neck look even shorter and stuffy.

2
00:00:14.232 --> 00:00:18.912
It also causes discomfort when bowing, since the bun bumps against the collar.

3
00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:25.752
In this case, we strongly recommend a mid bun, set at the middle of the back of the head.

4
00:00:26.088 --> 00:00:32.616
Creating space between the nape and the collar opens up the neckline, giving a slimmer, more confident look.
